 "rows": {"1.40.10(1)": {"explanation": "The zones in the Residential Zone category are Residential (R), Residential Detached (RD), Residential Semi-Detached (RS), Residential Townhouse (RT) and Residential Multiple (RM).", "code_refs": "none"}, "1.40.10(2)": {"explanation": "The Residential Zone category is for uses linked to the Official Plan Neighbourhoods designation: a range of residential building types, plus parks, local institutions and small-scale commercial uses.", "code_refs": "none"}, "1.40.10(3)": {"explanation": "Sets out the purpose of each residential zone: R, RD, RS, RT and RM each provide areas for a stated mix of detached, semi-detached, townhouse, houseplex and apartment building types, with townhouses and apartment buildings on major streets in some zones.", "code_refs": "none"}}}
